        "- remove any rules not exceeding threshold\n",
        "- returns: A dict containing only the rules with confidence >= threshold.\n",
        "- filtered_rules.update({rule: conf})\\\n",
        "If rule already exists in filtered_rules, its value is replaced with conf.\\\n",
        "If rule does not exist, a new entry is added."
